  title: Forest
  description: 'The frontier Forest, left of town above the Mine. Its trees grow
    tight: cut your way in. Further left are new kinds of wood; ridges of rock cross
    it (climb the pass by the cliff, or dig through). Stumps grow back unless you
    pull them out.'
  plannedPhase: 
  siteId: site.forest
